:note(item) -> name1
:note(_) [condition] -> name2
This will be named "name1". Should warn you about duplicate names.
[exit]

// This allows for two names on effectively the same object
:note(item3) -> extra_name
[skip]
:note(item1, item2) [condition]
:some_other_label
This block's name is the full text of the condition.
[exit]